      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had !! originally but switched it to this per a comment on the original CL.  You had suggested using .run but that had an issue.\n\nUsing assertNotNull in the way that you suggest was most appealing.  I wasn\u0027t able to do as you suggested because qosTestSocket is mutable (the tooling was upgraded which allowed me to use what you suggested in another spot.)\n\nBut... I was able to do it in such a way that is still elegant.",
